/-!
# Two movers, frozen readings [1, 2, 3, 4], one mover at or below 1: a lonely instant for ALL such pairs (GENERATED by `s2below_gen_v1.py`)

Written 2026-10-23.  New file.  Lonely pieces of the frozen set in one lap (period 1, exact): [1/8, 7/32], [9/32, 7/24], [3/8, 7/16], [9/16, 5/8], [17/24, 23/32], [25/32, 7/8].
* `small1234` (`0 < d1 ≤ 1/8`, `d1 ≤ d2`, no other bound): `d2 ≥ 3` by `small_A` on the widest piece `[1/8, 7/32]`; `d2 < 3` and `distInt d2 ≥ d1/2` by `small_II` at the frozen-clear
