  Patterns (j, sign: τ0, N): (1,+: 1/6, 0); (1,-: 5/6, 0); (2,+: 1/6, 0); (2,-: 1/6, 0); (3,+: 1/6, 0); (3,-: 1/6, 0).
* `col1234_<i>` (`1/8 ≤ d1 ≤ 1`): finite box cover of `{d1 ≤ d2}`, `3` columns in `d1`, `13` boxes, kinds {'P': 10, 'R1a': 3}, pieces up to lap 1 (lap-shifted copies of the frozen pieces;
  `ex_of_piece`).  [PROVISIONAL: covering]; `r1_rect` is [PROVISIONAL: counting tool].
* `exists_below_1234`: for ALL `0 < d1 ≤ 1`, `d1 ≤ d2`: `∃ t > 0, FClear F t ∧ Clear2 d1 d2 t`.
Grades: [L]; `small_II` (run lemma) and `small_A` are [PROVISIONAL: counting tool].  The cascade landing follows by `landing_of_ex` (`S2Below_All`).
-/

